    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new expedition has been organized</strong>. Desperate volunteers have been sent to an unknown island in the middle of the Pacific Ocean and gathered in an old building on the coast, awaiting deployment to carry out their mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/ef55f9a78e042229933558da6258e16f.poster.avif?t=1753042712\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/ef55f9a78e042229933558da6258e16f.webm?t=1753042712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/ef55f9a78e042229933558da6258e16f.mp4?t=1753042712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a top-down perspective captured by a drone camera, each volunteer must explore a massive abandoned structure, complete tasks assigned by a mysterious organization, and recover resources and equipment to bring back to the shelter\u2014improving their own chances of survival, and those of the ones who follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>When one volunteer dies, another is sent\u2014doomed to continue the mission from where the last one perished.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/abf5041b0b0dcbd67f050b8b9380515a.poster.avif?t=1753042712\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/abf5041b0b0dcbd67f050b8b9380515a.webm?t=1753042712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/abf5041b0b0dcbd67f050b8b9380515a.mp4?t=1753042712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned complexes, derelict power plants, dimly lit narrow corridors, and hundreds of rooms in this unsettling retrofuturistic experience infested with terrifying creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/42ae36cbf35f7dd75c772ca64500c7c9.poster.avif?t=1753042712\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/42ae36cbf35f7dd75c772ca64500c7c9.webm?t=1753042712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/42ae36cbf35f7dd75c772ca64500c7c9.mp4?t=1753042712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore countless zones of the Structure and the island, <strong>recover resources and gear, and bring them back to your shelter</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High replayability and dynamically generated levels</strong>\u2014no expedition will ever be the same</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your loadout</strong> with a wide array of firearms, melee weapons, gadgets, and more to survive the horrors within</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meta-progression system ensures every death brings something new, <strong>allowing steady progress run after run</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your volunteers\u2019 abilities</strong> using Upgrade Stations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the dark lore behind the Structure</strong> and the post\u2013World War II experiments that led to the project's catastrophic consequences</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find old blueprints to modify weapons or craft new ones</strong> at the Crafting Stations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete main and side quests</strong> to earn extra rewards and uncover disturbing new story details</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve environmental puzzles</strong>, <strong>retrieve access codes</strong> from vintage terminals, and <strong>discover personal diaries and research notes</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in the <strong>original black-and-white visual mode</strong> for an extra layer of dread</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new expedition has been organized</strong>. Desperate volunteers have been sent to an unknown island in the middle of the Pacific Ocean and gathered in an old building on the coast, awaiting deployment to carry out their mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/ef55f9a78e042229933558da6258e16f.poster.avif?t=1753042712\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/ef55f9a78e042229933558da6258e16f.webm?t=1753042712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/ef55f9a78e042229933558da6258e16f.mp4?t=1753042712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a top-down perspective captured by a drone camera, each volunteer must explore a massive abandoned structure, complete tasks assigned by a mysterious organization, and recover resources and equipment to bring back to the shelter\u2014improving their own chances of survival, and those of the ones who follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>When one volunteer dies, another is sent\u2014doomed to continue the mission from where the last one perished.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/abf5041b0b0dcbd67f050b8b9380515a.poster.avif?t=1753042712\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/abf5041b0b0dcbd67f050b8b9380515a.webm?t=1753042712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/abf5041b0b0dcbd67f050b8b9380515a.mp4?t=1753042712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned complexes, derelict power plants, dimly lit narrow corridors, and hundreds of rooms in this unsettling retrofuturistic experience infested with terrifying creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/42ae36cbf35f7dd75c772ca64500c7c9.poster.avif?t=1753042712\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/42ae36cbf35f7dd75c772ca64500c7c9.webm?t=1753042712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625840/extras/42ae36cbf35f7dd75c772ca64500c7c9.mp4?t=1753042712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore countless zones of the Structure and the island, <strong>recover resources and gear, and bring them back to your shelter</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High replayability and dynamically generated levels</strong>\u2014no expedition will ever be the same</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your loadout</strong> with a wide array of firearms, melee weapons, gadgets, and more to survive the horrors within</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meta-progression system ensures every death brings something new, <strong>allowing steady progress run after run</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your volunteers\u2019 abilities</strong> using Upgrade Stations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the dark lore behind the Structure</strong> and the post\u2013World War II experiments that led to the project's catastrophic consequences</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find old blueprints to modify weapons or craft new ones</strong> at the Crafting Stations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete main and side quests</strong> to earn extra rewards and uncover disturbing new story details</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve environmental puzzles</strong>, <strong>retrieve access codes</strong> from vintage terminals, and <strong>discover personal diaries and research notes</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in the <strong>original black-and-white visual mode</strong> for an extra layer of dread</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Take on the roles of expendable volunteers sent to a forsaken facility on a remote Japanese island. Recover lost data, scavenge for resources, manage your inventory, and endure unspeakable cosmic horrors. In this top-down extraction survival horror, every expedition is a journey back from madness.",
